0867001","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"该死的魔物！总有一天我一定要把它们全部杀死——啊痛痛痛！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1620867002:1":{"key":"say:2:1620867002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"行了行了，你快歇歇吧，别在这里放大话了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1620867003:1":{"key":"say:3:1620867003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"魔物一波又一波地来……哎，再这样，日子真要过不下去了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1620867004:1":{"key":"say:4:1620867004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"别总说丧气话！镇长这次请来的那些冒险者不是挺厉害的吗？...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1620867005:1":{"key":"say:5:1620867005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你倒是乐观……你数数看，镇子里都来了多少冒险者了？我们...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1620867006:1":{"key":"say:6:1620867006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我看这帮外来者压根就是骗子！委托费赚了不少，事情一样没...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1620867007:1":{"key":"say:7:1620867007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"过去大家一直说豪斯镇是这附近最安全的地方，很少有魔物出没。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1620867008:1":{"key":"say:8:1620867008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但现在魔物像是发了疯似的，明明周围还有其他的村镇，可它...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1620867009:1":{"key":"say:9:1620867009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620867009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"难道真是豪斯镇有问题？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","